Live Markdown local AI resources

The plugin does not bundle LLM inference executables or LLM model weights. On explicit
user request it downloads pinned resources and verifies their SHA-256 hashes.

llama.cpp: https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/tag/b11793
Runtime archives include the upstream LICENSE file.

Qwen3 0.6B / 1.7B Q4_K_M quantizations published by Unsloth:
https://huggingface.co/unsloth/Qwen3-0.6B-GGUF
https://huggingface.co/unsloth/Qwen3-1.7B-GGUF

Qwen3 4B Q4_K_M published by Qwen:
https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-4B-GGUF

Pinned revisions, per-file hashes, byte sizes and permitted download hosts are
in preload/local-ai/manifest-data.json. Consult each upstream repository for
license terms and model documentation.

